{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127093000789-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127102232\"/><p>今日大致天晴，吹微風。</p><p>廣東沿岸風勢微弱，天色大致良好。在今日(27日)上午9時，天文台錄得氣溫21度，相對濕度百分之75。過去一小時，京士柏錄得的平均紫外線指數是0.9，強度屬於低。</p><p>預測今日大致天晴，吹微風；展望周末期間至下周初大致天晴，本周六(28日)非常乾燥，下周日(29日)風勢頗大。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:43:54.979439+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T01:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:15.987833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:30.458051+00:00","content_hash":"a5be3328ff127df73b1304da42c152bdc1a06c90fb7005ae84f7e155f0ec2682","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:43:54.979439+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}